  "description": {
   "en": "Yamada Tarou commits murder after murder with indifference. The nature of how he does it is unknown, but victims are losing their lives one after another. The police activate to stop him, but...\n\nWhy does Yamada keep killing? What awaits this man who commits one heinous crime after another!?",
   "ja": "淡々と殺人を繰り返す男・山田太郎。彼の得体の知れない犯行方法により、被害者たちは次々と命を落としてしまうことに。その犯行を止めるべく動き出す警察組織だったが…。なぜ、山田は殺人を繰り返すのか。次々と凶行に及ぶ男を待つものとは——!?"
  },
